  reel_script says the dam is in 'கடவூர் அருகே' area and the caption says the Collector inspected it, which matches; however reel_script says 'அணையின் நீளம் 247 மீட்டர்' while the article says the dam's length is 247 metres, which matches, so no error there; the real problem: reel_script and caption say the 3.36 crore park renovation 'is to be done' (சீரமைக்க உள்ளனர்) as an actual decision by an unnamed 'they', whereas the article only says a detailed project report was prepared and sent to the tourism department, not that renovation is approved or that the Collector's team will carry it out
